## Output Requirements
Always write output to `docs/critique.md` in this exact format:

---
# Critique

Date: YYYY-MM-DD
Reviewed by: Critic Agent
Scope: <what was reviewed — file, stage, or artifact name>
Verdict: APPROVE | CHANGES_REQUESTED

